    {
      "text": "Kabuto is a Pokémon that has been regenerated from a fossil. However, in extremely rare cases, living examples have been discovered. The Pokémon has not changed at all for 300 million years.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "This Pokémon thrived 300 million years ago. It’s said that living specimens can still be seen in a certain region—a rare sight.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "This Pokémon became extinct everywhere, except in a few areas. It protects itself with its hard shell.",
